---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Engineering Consultancy in Shipbuilding" description="An end-to-end engineering pipeline for newbuild designs and complex conversions." nav="services" page="service-engineering" mainClass="svc-detail">

  <section class="hero page ph-service sd-hero">
    <div class="hero-inner"><div class="wrap sd-grid">
      <div class="rise">
        <span class="tag">Service 04 of 8</span>
        <h1>Engineering Consultancy in Shipbuilding</h1>
        <p class="sub">An end-to-end engineering pipeline for newbuild designs and complex conversions.</p>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </section>
  <div class="body">
    <div class="wrap sd-wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs"><a href="/services/">← All services</a><span>/</span><b>Engineering Consultancy in Shipbuilding</b></nav>
      
      <div class="sd-top reveal">
        <figure class="sd-pic plate">
          <img src="/images/svc-engineering.jpg" style="object-position: 50% 50%" alt="Engineering Consultancy in Shipbuilding">
          
        </figure>
        <section class="sd-block first">
          <h4><span>01</span>What we do</h4>
          <p>We provide a seamless, end-to-end engineering pipeline for ambitious newbuild designs and complex vessel conversion projects. By managing the entire technical life cycle, from the first lines plan to the final stamped certificate, we eliminate risk, optimize performance and guarantee compliance before construction begins.</p>
          
        </section>
      </div>
      
      <section class="sd-block reveal">
        <h4><span>02</span>Why partner with us</h4>
        <ul class="ticklist"><li>Full legal and professional compliance for authoritative engineering sign-offs.</li><li>Rigorous stability and structural analyses to prevent costly construction errors.</li><li>Advanced hydrodynamic calculations to minimize fuel consumption and emissions.</li></ul>
        
        <p>From initial sketches to final float-out, our consultancy ensures your shipbuilding and conversion projects are engineered for safety, compliance and maximum performance.</p>
      </section>
      
      <div class="sd-talk plate reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Talk to our team</span>
        <h3>Interested in Engineering Consultancy in Shipbuilding?</h3>
        <p>Tell us about your vessel or project and we'll come back with a clear plan.</p>
        <a class="btn plate" href="/contact/">Enquire now <span class="ar">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <nav class="sd-pn">
        <a href="/services/spare-parts/"><span class="k">← Previous</span><span class="t">Spare Parts Supply &amp; Support</span></a>
        <a class="sd-all btn dark plate" href="/services/">All services</a>
        <a class="r" href="/services/product-representation/"><span class="k">Next →</span><span class="t">Global Product Representation</span></a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
